        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Rek'Sai generates Fury by Attacking and hitting with basic Abilities. She consumes this Fury while Burrowed to restore health.",
        "bodyHtml": "Rek'Sai generates <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">25 Fury</span> when she Attacks and <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">25 Fury</span> from Abilities.<br /><br />While <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Burrowed</span>, she consumes her <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Fury</span> to restore up to <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(9/20% Health) Health</span> over 3 seconds, increasing with level.",
